<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Covenant Transport cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Covenant Transport cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Covenant Transport Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said trimmed the 1997 earnings view to $1.00 a share from $1.10 a share and cut the 1998 earnings estimate to $1.25 from $1.40.</p>
<p>-- Covenant Transport lost 1/2 to 11-1/2.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
